350	    /**
351	     * The fiscal year a date falls in, as a full calendar year. The fiscal year starts on 1 July and
352	     * is named by the calendar year in which it ends: a date in July through December belongs to the
353	     * next calendar year's fiscal year, while January through June stays in the current one.
354	     *
355	     * @param date the date to classify
356	     * @return the fiscal year as a four-digit calendar year
